\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{Generated tokens and executable actions}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{agent}

\p{An action serializer maps generated text to an executable action. Section 2
of \citef{yao2023react} writes actions and observations in a textual
trajectory. The proposed serializer interface in \ref{ftip-004P} additionally
distinguishes malformed calls, constrained grammars, and environment actions.}

\p{An improvement can therefore come from better reasoning, better
serialization, or a more permissive parser. These are separate intervention
coordinates.}
